				<description>


&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ian-mcleod&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5089011&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606790725&quot; alt=&quot;Ian-McLeod&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5089011)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ian-mcleod&quot;  &gt;Ian-McLeod&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 01 Dec 2020 02:43:24 +0000</pubDate>
												<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong></p> <p>Vital fluids and saliva specimens of SCP-5161 are confined in glass test tubes stored in a titanium safe vault within a lead-cladden room situated below an antebellum leading to the entrance. The pathogen itself is contained at Bio-Site-23 for a furtherance in study at Research Site-23.</p> <p><strong>Update:</strong> In addition to security protocol, doors are to be triple-locked with the exception of allowing Level 4 authorized personnel in or out. No fewer than two (2) armed guards are to be around the premises. The safe itself is to be secured manually with a fingerprinted scanner and must be unlocked with a USB data-key flash drive in succession.</p> <p>Personnel with level 4 clearance wishing to experiment with the pathogen are required to seek direct approval from members of the Ethics Committee and the O5-Council. Illicit testing of 5161 without authorization will see personnel demoted/stripped of their security clearance and/or omitted from the program. Unauthorized personnel attempting to violate this regulation well then be restrained and removed by force; with any resistance resulting in an immediate termination.</p> <p>Monthly inoculation of SCP-5161 are held in semi-artificial enclosures within forested areas that are restricted from the general public.</p> <p>D-personnel are to be nude for the procedure of thorough analysis when testing SCP-5161. SCP-5161-1-infected individuals are then to be shuttled away to the artificial habitats in order for the subject to feel at ease in the “back-to-nature” lifestyle as the transfiguration progressed.</p> <p>Natural responses of living in a natural habitat have been deemed comfortable for most off the individuals that are now labeled 5161-1.</p> <div id="wiki-tabview-c760c33af157cc058e0bfecb85523ba2" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>5161-1</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>5161-2</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Known Subjects</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <p>Contents of Tab 1</p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <p>Contents of Tab 2</p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-2" style="display:none"> <p>Contents of Tab 3</p> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ian-mcleod" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5089011&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606790725" alt="Ian-McLeod" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5089011)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ian-mcleod" >Ian-McLeod</a></span></p> 
