&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-638202-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. If applicable, have a link here to the specific entry on the &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/task-forces&quot;&gt;canon list&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-638202-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. For &#039;canon&#039; task forces, or those with individual hub pages, just include a link. Hubs take priority over the &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/task-forces&quot;&gt;canon list&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-638202-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. Feel free to write whatever here if it&#039;s your MTF, but try to keep it fairly unobjectionable if it&#039;s not. It&#039;s not mandatory, but something more detailed than &amp;quot;SCP-specific Task Force&amp;quot; would be nice!&lt;/div&gt;
